#new:Function $Function_GetTattle
{
LIO       V0, $String_Tattle
JR        RA
RESERVED
}

% Strings


#string $String_Tattle
{
[Style Tattle][EnableCDownNext]
This is Rougeport.[BR]
[Pause 8]Wait, what the heck? Weren't we[BR]
just in [SaveColor][Color:05]Kinoko Town[RestoreColor] a moment ago?[BR]
[Wait][Next]
There doesn't seem to be many[BR]
people around, so we can meander[BR]
at our leisure I suppose.[BR]
[Wait][Next]
Dang, that means no ladies though.[BR]
[Pause 10][PrintRising]What am I gonna do?[BR]
We don't want a bored Goombarius.[/fx][BR]
[Wait][End]
}
